A group of special stages only appears 2 days per month. Upon completing one of the stages, the player will be rewarded with the Crazed Cat that appeared as the Boss.

==Crazed Cats==
[[File:Crazed img01 en.png|thumb]]
"From February 3rd, take on those Crazed Cat Blitz stages, available for only a short time at the Stories of Legend in The Battle Cats app!

If you have the guts and strength to triumph these "Insane" stages, you will be rewarded with a unit from this series of powerful Super Rares!

So, power up your Cats to the max and take on these fearsome opponents - spoils of victory await!"

==Manic Cats==
[[File:Daikyouran full img01 en.jpg|thumb]]
"Are you a Battle Cats pro? Have you collected all 9 Crazed Cats?

If so, take on these Deadly-difficulty stages in Stories of Legend and unlock the final form of the Crazed Cat units!

Can you handle this ultimate challenge? Prove it by clearing a different stage every day!!!"

==Schedule==
*3rd and 26th of each month 12:00 AM to 11:59 PM: [[Dark Souls (Insane)|The Crazed Cat]] ([[Deathhawk (Deadly)|Cat Maniac]])
*6th and 27th of each month 12:00 AM to 11:59 PM: [[Absolute Defense (Insane)|The Crazed Tank]] ([[Vulcanizer (Deadly)|Tank Maniac]])
*9th and 28th of each month 12:00 AM to 11:59 PM: [[Berserk (Insane)|The Crazed Axe]] ([[Unjust War (Deadly)|Axe Maniac]])
*12th and 26th of each month 12:00 AM to 11:59 PM: [[Festival Gross (Insane)|The Crazed Gross]] ([[Muscle Party (Deadly)|Gross Maniac]])
*15th and 27th of each month 12:00 AM to 11:59 PM: [[Head Shaker (Insane)|The Crazed Cow]] ([[Lots O' Lion (Deadly)|Cow Maniac]])
*18th and 28th of each month 12:00 AM to 11:59 PM: [[Flappy Cat (Insane)|The Crazed Bird]] ([[Forest Beasts (Deadly)|Bird Maniac]])
*21st and 26th of each month 12:00 AM to 11:59 PM: [[Fish Hell (Insane)|The Crazed Fish]] ([[Ogre Island (Deadly)|Fish Maniac]])
*24th and 27th of each month 12:00 AM to 11:59 PM: [[Mammals? (Insane)|The Crazed Lizard]] ([[Draconian (Deadly)|Lizard Maniac]])
*27th and 28th of each month 12:00 AM to 11:59 PM: [[Crazy Cats (Insane)|The Crazed Titan]] ([[Resident Feline (Deadly)|Titan Maniac]])

The Crazed True Form levels will appear when all 9 levels above were cleared.

