==Clan of the Maniacs==
Clan of the Maniacs is a set of 2 stages unlocked after all 9 original Crazed Cat stages are completed. It appears on the first of every month and features all 9 Crazed Cats in one stage.
*[[Clan of the Maniacs]]
**[[The Wild Dance (Deadly)]]
**[[Insane Rhythms (Merciless)]]

